This licence covers the Go source in this repository.

It does NOT cover the captured chain data under testdata/ — those files are
consensus artifacts produced by the validators of a public test network and are
reproduced here verbatim so the verification can be replayed offline. See
testdata/README.md for the endpoint, chain ID, height and capture time of every
file.
